1. git reset --soft

Run:

git reset --soft HEAD~1

Check:

git log --oneline
git status

Observation:

Commit C is removed from history.

Changes are still in the staging area.

git status shows Changes to be committed.

Diagram

Commit C ❌
Changes still staged ✅

When to use?

Wrong commit message

Want to combine or edit commits

Removes the last commit

Keeps changes staged

Use it to fix a commit message or squash commits.

